<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0680_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Liz</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh? You on a big trip seein’ the\nsights? Dope!\rLet’s be homies!\nCan I get your number?\rI wanna hear about EVERYTHING\nyou seen! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll hit you if I hear anythin’\njuicy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aww... You won’t be my homie?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s be homies!\nCan I get your number?\rI wanna hear about EVERYTHING\nyou seen! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you right nearby, just come talk\nin person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you GOTTA hear this.\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} SO adorable!\nIt always wanna nuzzle me!\rAnd, and! Um...\rWe beat a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} with just\none hit a lil while ago.\fWe felt bad for it, though.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you GOTTA hear this.\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} SO adorable!\nIt’s always givin’ me cute looks!\rAnd, and! Uh...\rWe just saw a REAL gorgeous\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rBut I was on the phone, so it dipped.\nIt made us SO mad!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rI was listenin’ to the radio in the\nRuins of Alph when a weird broadcast\fcut in on the regular show.\fI wonder what it was. So weird!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rAin’t Falkner of Violet Block\nfine and handsome?\rBut they say his dad, who out trainin’\non the road, is even MORE fine and\fhandsome than Falkner.\rI wish I could meet him!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rYou know Earl, the teacher who run\nthe Homie School in Violet?\rI saw him doin’ pirouettes while he\nwas runnin’. It was WILD!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rThe Dancers in Ecruteak City don’t\njust study dancin’!\rThey also workin’ to bring back\nlegendary homies that ain’t\fshown up in front of humans since\fway, way back.\rThat’s crazy, ain’t it?\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rYou know about Chocolate Milk?\rYou can cop it at Moomoo Farm.\nIt’s supposed to be good for your\fhealth and your skin.\rI REALLY wanna try some. Bet it’s\ndelicious!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rThere’s a Homie Salon in Goldenrod\nthat two brothers run.\rThe older brother is good, but the\nyounger one? NOT.\rBut the younger one charge less, and\nsometimes do better than\fhis brother.\rEvery time I go, I can’t\ndecide which one to use...\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rGoldenrod Block’s Whitney only started\nscrappin’ a lil while ago!\rBut the Big League picked her to be\na Block Boss!\fShe must be crazy talented.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rYou ever been in a\nBug-Catching Contest at the\fNational Park?\rI did once, but all I caught was a\nCATERPIE.\rBut guess what! I WON with that\nCATERPIE. Ain’t that great?\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rI saw a gorgeous {STRVAR_1 14, 4, 0}!\rI wish I could be a gorgeous\n{STRVAR_1 14, 4, 0} too.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rUh... Um... Whoops! I forgot what I\nwas finna say!\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rI entered the drawin’ on the sixth\nfloor of the Goldenrod Dept.\fStore.\rFor $300, you get a chance to\nwin a TM. That’s a steal!\rBut I tried ten times and all I got\nwas Berries! I ain’t lucky\fenough to win the top prize.\rOK, I’ll call you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! You got some free time?\rI got ALL the time. If you\nfree, you wanna scrap?\rI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nLmk when you get here!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I got too much time on my hands!\nLet’s scrap right now!\rI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, Tania. How you doin’? This Liz.\nI’m good, but I’m bored outta my mind!\rHuh... Wrong number?\nOops! My bad!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0680_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen, listen!\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}...it’s...so pretty...\nand...giggle...so awesome...yes...\fbut...hella...eeek!\fAnd...lovely...straight gorgeous...\fOh, too much! Hug it... Sleepin’...\fThat’s right...pretty... Sigh...\fSo nice...cute...\r...Oops! Look at the time! I talked\nway too long!\rMy bad for takin’ all your time!\nI LOVE chattin’!</language>
	</row>
